@Comment:	Time is 0:05
@Comment:	MOT announces date and participants (MOT and Chi) at beginning of 9 minute mealtime , and tells Chi to talk like normally does. Mot interviews Chi , who doesn't talk much. Mot tells a narrative about a man in the park. High level of awareness of tape recorder , MOT trying to get Chi to talk on tape. They talk about the study , and Mot says it would be nice if at the end we gave them a tape with samples of Chi's speech from different ages. Chi signs off by saying she's enjoyed working with us for 7 years and will continue if we want
